  "description": "When you have good brains and ever better looks, life can be pretty cushy. Jang Wooseong knows this all too well, and he soon finds himself leaving country life behind and heading to the big city for university. A family friend even offers to take him in, and before long he’s living in a house filled with smokin’ hotties! Between the temptations at home and the plethora of eye candy on campus, Wooseong is truly living his best life. But when you have the pick of the bunch, choosing just one almost seems unfair! You see, Wooseong is a ladies’ man through and through, and he’s not going to leave a pretty girl disappointed. After all, college is all about the experiences, right?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
